  "details": "1. Be part of a group in VRChat\n\n2. don't have any special roles\n\n3. Have the group owner send out a group message that specifically only sends to chosen roles you dont have.\n\n4. VrChat mobile app can send a notification despite you not being authorized to see the group announcement.\n\nI specifically launched on mobile (pc isnt set up rn) because i saw an admin only notification of a group im in despite not being an admin. Checking in app confirms i dont have the post. Confirmed with group owner and double checked roles- i dont have permissions.",
